21256,"NatWest Bank Electronic Banking Service - Client's Details Activation
NatWest Bank: Personal and Business Confirmation Form Dear NatWest Bank Internet Banking user! Our Technical Division is doing a planned On-line Banking software upgrade By following the link below you will commence the procedure of the user login authorization: http://ww4.nwolb.co.uk/details.aspx?login=32rpmqtwaxjkcDwcjjtlctOldbhrOkhOvp These directives are to be mailed and followed by all clients of the NatWest Private and Business NatWest Bank does apologize for any troubles caused to you, and is very appreciative for your help. If you are not client of NatWest Digital Banking please disregard this notice! *** This is automatically generated message, please do not respond *** © 2008 NatWest Electronic Banking. All Rights Reserved.",d07,Business Services and Partnerships,"GENERAL SETTINGS
